'yum_DESC_YUM_PACKAGEFUNCTIONS' => '(en)The software installer can manage groups of related package or individual packages. By default, only groups of packages are presented. If you wish to manage individual packages, enable this option. This should only be done by experienced administrators.',
'yum_LABEL_ENABLED_REPOSITORIES' => '有効なリポジトリ',
'yum_DESC_ENABLED_REPOSITORIES' => '(en)The software installer can install software from any of enabled repositories. To enable a repository, select it from the list. To disable a repository, de-select it from the list. By default, only stable, tested software is available for installation.',
'yum_DESC_UPTODATE' => 'すべての更新がインストールされました。',
'yum_DESC_UPDATES_AVAILABLE' => '(en)There are updates available for your system. These updates should be installed as soon as possible.',
'yum_LABEL_AVAILABLE_UPDATES' => '更新があります',
'yum_DESC_AVAILABLE_UPDATES' => '(en)The following updates are available for your system. You should normally install all available updates. If there are updates you do not wish to install, de-select them from the list below.',
'yum_INSTALL_UPDATES' => '選択した更新プログラムをインストール',
'yum_HEADER_AVAILABLE_SOFTWARE' => '(en)The following software is available to be installed onto your system. You should only install additional software onto this system if you are aware of the consequences of doing so.',
'yum_DESC_AVAILABLE_GROUPS' => '(en)You can select software groups to install from the list below.',
'yum_LABEL_AVAILABLE_GROUPS' => '利用可能なグループ',
'yum_DESC_AVAILABLE_PACKAGES' => '(en)You can also select individual packages to install from the list below.',
'yum_LABEL_AVAILABLE_PACKAGES' => '利用可能なパッケージ',
'yum_INSTALL_SOFTWARE' => 'インストール',
'yum_HEADER_INSTALLED_SOFTWARE' => '(en)The following software is installed on this system. You should only remove software from this system if you are aware of the consequences of doing so.',
'yum_DESC_INSTALLED_GROUPS' => '(en)You can select software groups to remove from the list below.',
'yum_LABEL_INSTALLED_GROUPS' => 'インストール済みグループ',
'yum_DESC_INSTALLED_PACKAGES' => '(en)You can also select individual packages you wish to remove from the list below.',
'yum_LABEL_INSTALLED_PACKAGES' => 'インストール済みパッケージ',
'yum_HEADER_POSTUPGRADE_REQUIRED' => '(en)The system needs to be reconfigured after adding or removing software, or applying updates. <p> Please click on the Reconfigure button at the bottom of this page to start the reconfiguration process. <b>An automatic reboot will be initiated as part of this reconfiguration process</b> </p>',
